I'd just started a new character and my Valk was on Dlvl 2.  She came
to a door that was marked Closed For Inventory.  I had no way of
picking or unlocking the door, so I moved on.

Went to a different part of the level and found a spellbook, which I
read.

You feel a wrenching sensation...

Yep, I found myself inside the store, which was a jeweler's.  The
shopkeeper was very friendly but there was no way out as the door was
locked.  I had no way of unlocking the door or picking its lock, no
wand of digging, no pickaxe for that matter, no gold to pay for a
broken door, and nothing in the shop was of help.  In the end, I broke
the door, angered the shopkeeper, and died to a wand of striking
before I could get away.

After I died it occurred to me I could have read the book again,
perhaps, or have played with the rings hoping to find a Ring of
Teleport or something.








